        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>DevOps</p>",
            "<p>Culture/Practice</p>",
            "<p>Combines Dev + Ops; shared responsibility; automate everything; faster delivery</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>CI (Continuous Integration)</p>",
            "<p>Practice</p>",
            "<p>Developers merge code frequently; automated build + test on each merge</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>CD (Continuous Delivery)</p>",
            "<p>Practice</p>",
            "<p>Software always ready to deploy; manual trigger for production</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>CD (Continuous Deployment)</p>",
